Engine (rust/)
--------------

`rust/` contains the single-binary engine. Its IPP server is a port of:

  paperlessprinter — https://github.com/paperlesspaper/paperlessprinter
  License: GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0)

The entire Rust crate is therefore licensed under AGPL-3.0 (see rust/LICENSE),
not MIT.

The Rust build embeds PDFium (https://pdfium.googlesource.com/pdfium/),
BSD-3-Clause, obtained from https://github.com/bblanchon/pdfium-binaries
(release chromium/7881, SHA-256 pinned in rust/build.rs). See
rust/third_party/pdfium/LICENSE. The dll is downloaded at build time and is
never committed to this repository.

History
-------

Until 2026-07, this project ran paperlessprinter directly (cloned at setup
into `paperlessprinter/`, gitignored) with Python wrapper scripts. The Python
stack has been replaced by the Rust port; legacy installs may still contain
the clone and are subject to AGPL-3.0 for that component.
